<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pasminco Q2 zinc output slightly up.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pasminco Q2 zinc output slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pasminco Ltd said on Wednesday its zinc production totalled 134,019 tonnes in the December quarter, up a 1.9 percent over the period a year earlier ago.</p>
<p>For the six months to December 31, Pasminco produced 265,888 tonnes of zinc, down an 0.8 percent on the year-earlier period.  </p>
